This intricate spell erects a space distortion around the caster that is linked to another distortion, placed around a target.

Any time the caster should take damage, there is a [45%, 50%, 55%, 60%, 65% (TL1-5)] chance that it will instead be warped by the shield and hit the designated target.

Once the maximum damage ([298, 384, 451, 508, 558 (TL1-5; SP 100)]) is absorbed, the time runs out ([13, 16, 19, 22, 25 (TL1-5)] turns), or the target dies, the shield will crumble.

The max damage the shield can absorb will increase with your Spellpower.
